0..54 Comment "// This source writes exit handlers as explicit folds."
55..57 Comment "//"
58..114 Comment "// The tree is the free model of `std.process.Exit.Eff`."
115..117 Comment "//"
118..161 Comment "// Each fold implements one handler clause."
162..238 Comment "// A deep handler reinstalls itself in the continuation. So a clause resumes"
239..285 Comment "// by a fold of what the continuation answers."
286..288 Comment "//"
289..331 Comment "// - see: `exit.gandr` — native handlers"
